{"Title":"An Act relative to the definition of Group 4 of the retirement system","BillNumber":"H2473","DocketNumber":"HD2035","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:52:52.233"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:52:52.2333333"},{"Id":null,"Name":"David Holway","Type":3,"Details":null,"ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:52:52.25"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H2473/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Chan of Quincy, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 2473) of Tackey Chan and David Holway relative to placing licensed electricians employed by the Commonwealth in Group 4 of the contributory retirement system for public employees.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. The definition of Group 4, as set forth in Chapter 32, Section 3, paragraph (2), subparagraph (g) is hereby amended by adding thereto the words:— employees of the Commonwealth and its political subdivisions who are employed as licensed electricians.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}